# NOTICE

`AbstractSymbology.ili` is unmodified, fetched from
`https://models.interlis.ch/refhb24/AbstractSymbology.ili` (the official
INTERLIS models catalog - openly published for reuse).

`StandardSymbology_ext.ili` is an ADAPTED copy of
`https://models.interlis.ch/refhb24/StandardSymbology.ili` -
**not the official model**. It renames `MODEL StandardSymbology` to
`StandardSymbologyFontSymbolImageExt` (so it is never confused with, or
accidentally loaded alongside, the real one - see
`tests/fixtures/cartosym/roadsexgm2ien_repo/StandardSymbology.ili` for
that) and adds one project-proposed extension: a 3rd
`FontSymbol.Geometry` `RESTRICTION` variant, `FontSymbol_Image EXTENDS
FontSymbol_Geometry = Uri: TEXT; END FontSymbol_Image;`, matching
`pycartosym`'s own `examples/sld/15-image-marker.sld` fixture. Proposed
and validated conditionally by the maintainer, implemented 2026-09-13
once `pycartosym` v0.3.2 made `ImageGraphic.hotSpot` usable via the typed
API. No other content was changed.
